{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27053","headline":"新昌里 · 姚合","name":"新昌里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧客常乐坊，井泉浊而咸。\n新屋新昌里，井泉清而甘。\n僮仆惯苦饮，食美翻憎嫌。\n朝朝忍饥行，戚戚如难堪。\n中下无正性，所习便淫耽。\n一染不可变，甚於茜与蓝。\n近贫日益廉，近富日益贪。\n以此当自警，慎勿信邪谗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27053.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27053","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}